Package: pkgdec27
Title: Sampling Random Sorting Networks of Type B
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Taizo", "Sadahiro", , "sadahiro@tsuda.ac.jp", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements exact sampling algorithms for random sorting networks of Coxeter type B via standard Young tableaux of shifted staircase shape and the Edelman–Greene bijection These methods enable experimental and theoretical studies of random sorting networks.
